silm:instances_papers_21_ologs_and_typed_english_chapters_08_cross_paper_bridges_sections_04_bridge_to_18_presheaf_semantics_concrete_anchor_4_N#domesticcatbox silm:hasLongDescription "The DomesticCatBox is a typed-noun box whose presheaf is the Yoneda image. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'N', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
